.TH std::bad_function_call 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::bad_function_call \- std::bad_function_call

.SH Synopsis
Defined in header <functional>
class bad_function_call;

std::bad_function_call is the type of the exception thrown by std::function::operator() if
the function wrapper has no target.

